# meta

## the name

unseen servant is the d&d cantrip: an invisible force that fetches, carries and tidies, doing simple work unseen. that is the job description. the short name takes the letters from the long one:

```how usv gets its name
UnSeen serVant  ->  u s v
```

abbreviated rather than spelled out because it is also a command you type.

## status

released: v1.0.1, 2026-08-30, every artefact signed. the releases page is the one place that cannot go stale:

=> https://forgejo.unseenservant.dev/unseen-servant/unseen-servant/releases releases, notes and artefacts

next: independent eyes on the security posture, packages into distribution repositories, and whatever the first real bug reports teach. this page is a snapshot; the repository is the source of truth.

